#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1199
#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1377
msgid "**Method**"
msgstr "**Metodo**"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:897
