msgstr "``gc_errorx``: la coordinata x del centroide dello spazio vuoto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:989
msgid "``gc_errory``: the y coordinate of the centroid of the gap."
msgstr "``gc_errory``: la coordinata y del centroide dello spazio vuoto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:990
msgid "``gc_error``: the area of the gap."
msgstr "``gc_error``: l'area dello spazio vuoto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:991
msgid "``gc_errorid``: the ID of the gap."
msgstr "``gc_errorid``: l'ID dello spazio vuoto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:992
msgid "``report``: a text field mentioning the method used to fix the gap."
msgstr ""
"``report``: un campo di testo in cui si indica il metodo utilizzato per "
"correggere lo spazio vuoto."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:998
msgid ""
"Output layer of polygons without gaps. The layer contains the same fields as"
" in the input layer."
msgstr ""
"Layer in uscita composto da poligoni senza spazi vuoti. Il layer contiene "
"gli stessi campi del layer in ingresso."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1004
msgid "**Algorithm ID**: ``native:fixgeometrygap``"
msgstr "**ID algoritmo**: ``native:fixgeometrygap``"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1014
msgid "Fill holes"
msgstr "Riempire i buchi"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1017
msgid ""
"Deletes holes in polygon geometries based on an error layer from the "
":ref:`qgischeckgeometryhole` algorithm."
msgstr ""
"Elimina i buchi nelle geometrie poligonali in base a un livello di errore "
"generato dall'algoritmo :ref:`qgischeckgeometryhole`."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1023
msgid "Deleting holes in a polygon feature."
msgstr "Eliminazione buchi in un elemento poligonale."

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1025
msgid ":ref:`qgisdeleteholes`"
msgstr ":ref:`qgisdeleteholes`"

#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1057
#: ../../docs/user_manual/processing_algs/qgis/fixgeometry.rst:1226
